{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_025roc_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_025roc_4101_025roc", "source_sha256": "99ca84aebb855ca3abb407fce7c24270b4476d2d65442b9eee3c551ee6768d65", "ja": "{$P$}も、そう思いますか！？\nさすが、ロコの理解者ですね♪", "zh": "{$P$}也这么想吗！？\n你最懂ROCO了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
